<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley cuts IXC.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley cuts IXC.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it cut IXC Communications Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 2-1/8 to 27-1/2 in early trading Thursday, but volume was slim.</p>
</text>
